    {
      "id": "block-be9a3108c4a28b74161d90bd",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Rationale - Salmon aquaculture operations must, as a baseline, adhere to the national\nand local laws of the regions where production is taking place. Farm operations that,\nintentionally or unintentionally, break the law violate a fundamental benchmark of\nperformance for certified farms. It is important that aquaculture operations demonstrate\na pattern of legal and responsible behaviour, including the implementation of corrective\nactions for any legal violations.",
      "level": 1,
      "parent_id": null,
      "numbering": "",
      "dependencies": [],
      "source_refs": [
